---
layout: base.njk
title: "Dr Jon Durrant – Embedded Systems, Robotics & Pico | Dr Jon EA"
socialTitle: "Dr Jon Durrant – engineer, maker and educator"
description: "Brighton engineer behind Dr Jon EA: Raspberry Pi Pico and RP2350 tutorials, droid builds, Udemy courses and talks, backed by 25+ years of IT architecture."
schema: schema-person.njk
date: git Last Modified
---
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="container header-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Jon Durrant, home">
      <img src="/img/jd-mark.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36">
      <span>Jon Durrant</span>
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="Sections">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
        <li><a href="#courses">Courses</a></li>
        <li><a href="#talks">Talks</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main" class="wrapper">
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="hero-content container">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Engineer · Maker · Educator</p>
        <h1>Dr Jon Durrant</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          I build robots and embedded systems on the Raspberry Pi Pico and RP2350,
          and teach others to do the same as <strong>Dr Jon EA</strong>, from Brighton, UK.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before that I spent over 25 years in software engineering and IT architecture.
          Now I share practical guides on <a href="{{ site.profiles.youtube }}">YouTube</a>,
          write them up on <a href="{{ site.profiles.blog }}">the blog</a>, publish the code on
          <a href="{{ site.profiles.github }}">GitHub</a> and teach courses on
          <a href="{{ site.profiles.udemy }}">Udemy</a>.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="cta" href="{{ site.profiles.youtube }}">Watch on YouTube</a>
          <a class="cta cta-secondary" href="{{ site.profiles.blog }}">Read the Dr Jon EA blog</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait">
        <img src="/img/jon-durrant.webp" alt="Portrait of Dr Jon Durrant" width="219" height="219">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="about-h">About</h2>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <p>
            I got my first computer, a Dragon 32, at ten and never really stopped. After a BSc in computer
            science and a PhD in object-oriented methods for distributed systems, both at the
            University of Brighton, I started out writing embedded C, then moved into solution and enterprise architecture.
          </p>
          <p>
            That took me through Nortel Networks, TUI, Sainsbury's, Sony Interactive Entertainment
            (PlayStation), where I was Senior Director of Architecture, and Legal &amp; General.
            In 2021 I set up Dr Jon EA Ltd to go back to building things with my hands and to teach.
          </p>
          <p>
            My videos and courses cover the Pico and RP2350, FreeRTOS, IoT with MQTT and HTTP,
            ROS 2 and micro-ROS, displays, PCB design and 3D printing, mostly through projects
            you can build yourself.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ul class="facts" aria-label="At a glance">
          <li><span>Focus</span>Raspberry Pi Pico, RP2350, FreeRTOS, IoT, robotics</li>
          <li><span>Background</span>25+ years in software and enterprise architecture</li>
          <li><span>Teaching</span>YouTube since 2022, Udemy courses on the Pico and IT leadership</li>
          <li><span>Code</span><a href="{{ site.profiles.github }}">jondurrant</a> and <a href="{{ site.profiles.githubOrg }}">DrJonEA</a> on GitHub</li>
          <li><span>Based in</span>Brighton, UK</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-h">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="projects-h">Projects</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Droids, sensors and the odd spooky build. Each one is a video series with open source code.</p>
      <ul class="cards">
        {%- for p in home.projects %}
        <li class="card">
          <a href="{{ p.href }}">
            <img src="{{ p.img }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" width="{{ p.width }}" height="{{ p.height }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="object-position: {{ p.position }}">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h3>{{ p.name }} <small>{{ p.years }}</small></h3>
              <p>{{ p.blurb }}</p>
              <span class="more">{{ p.cta }} →</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="guides" aria-labelledby="guides-h">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="guides-h">Popular guides</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">The videos people come back to most.</p>
      <ul class="cards cards-small">
        {%- for g in home.guides %}
        <li class="card">
          <a href="{{ g.href }}">
            <img src="{{ g.img }}" alt="" width="320" height="180" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="card-body"><h3>{{ g.title }}</h3></div>
          </a>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p><a class="more" href="{{ site.profiles.youtube }}/videos">All videos on YouTube →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="courses" aria-labelledby="courses-h">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="courses-h">Courses</h2>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <h3 class="col-title">Embedded development</h3>
          <ul class="course-list">
            {%- for c in home.courses.embedded %}
            <li><a href="{{ c.href }}">{{ c.title }}</a><span>{{ c.pitch }}</span></li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="col-title">IT leadership</h3>
          <ul class="course-list">
            {%- for c in home.courses.leadership %}
            <li><a href="{{ c.href }}">{{ c.title }}</a><span>{{ c.pitch }}</span></li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p><a class="more" href="{{ site.profiles.udemy }}">All courses on Udemy →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="talks" aria-labelledby="talks-h">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="talks-h">Talks and events</h2>
      <ul class="events">
        {%- for e in home.events %}
        <li>
          <time datetime="{{ e.date }}">{{ e.label }}</time>
          <div><strong>{{ e.event }}</strong> <span class="role">{{ e.role }}</span><br>{{ e.what }}</div>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-h">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="contact-h">Contact</h2>
      <p>For sponsorships, partnerships, talks or consulting, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
      <ul class="social">
        <li><a href="{{ site.profiles.youtube }}">YouTube</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ site.profiles.blog }}">Blog</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ site.profiles.udemy }}">Udemy</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ site.profiles.linkedin }}">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ site.profiles.github }}">GitHub</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <p>&copy; {{ site.year }} Jon Durrant · <a href="https://drjonea.co.uk">Dr Jon EA Ltd</a></p>
  </div>
</footer>
